The '''Thursday Blitz Stage''' or '''Thursday Guerrilla Stage''' (ゲリラ木曜ステージ ''Gerira Mokuyō Sutēji'') is a harder version of the regular [[Thursday Stage]]s. Every time the player beats this stage, they will be rewarded with a [[Sniper the Cat]].

