==Battleground==
*20 [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Maawth]] spawns after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*5 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*5 [[Helmut Krabbe]]s spawn after 66 seconds<sup>1,980f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 75% HP:
**1 [[Nimoy Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**20 [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 4~8 seconds<sup>120f~240f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Shibalien]]s spawn, delay 8.33~16.67 seconds<sup>250f~500f</sup>.
**5 [[LeMurr]]s spawn, delay 8~12 seconds<sup>240f~360f</sup>.
**3 [[I.M. Phace]]s spawn, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This level becomes much easier as you collect the [[Aqua Crystal]]/[[Plasma Crystal]]. It helps to have [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] because he can essentially stunlock the LeMurrs, Phaces, and Nimoy Bore, making the level very easy. [[Neo Psychocat]] also helps, but only against Nimoy Bore because I.M. Phace outranges him by 1 (366 range vs. 365 range).

If you have no [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien units]], this level is not easy but is still beatable. It is highly recommended that you do have anti-Alien units, especially those who have a [[Freeze]] or [[Slow]] ability, along with at least 200% [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures|anti-Alien Treasures]].

